	(text "All seven 74HC165 share SR_PL_N and SR_CLK; each Q7 goes to its own GPIO (SR_Q0-6), so the PIO reads 7 bits per clock.\nChain 0-3: coils 1-32. Chain 4: J12 strobes 1-6, 8, 9. Chain 5: J12 10, 11 + J13 columns 1, 3-7. Chain 6: J13 8, 10 (JP2) + 6 spares."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 12.7 0)
		(effects
			(font
